# Edit or create an encrypted secret - from the dotfiles repo root
# (wraps ragenix's two required flags; see justfile group 'secrets'):
just edit-secret personal/<name>.age

# Re-key all secrets (after adding recipients in secrets/secrets.nix):
just rekey-secrets

# Bare agenix/ragenix FAILS without both flags:
#   "./secrets.nix does not exist"  -> rules live at secrets/secrets.nix
#   "No matching keys found"        -> identity is ~/.age/personal-key.txt
#                                      (RAGENIX_IDENTITY overrides), not ~/.ssh
# Raw equivalent when the justfile isn't at hand:
ragenix --rules secrets/secrets.nix -i ~/.age/personal-key.txt -e secrets/personal/<name>.age
